# ── AppImage & distribution archives (too large for git; use GitHub Releases) ───
*.AppImage
*.AppImage.bak
*.zsync
*.tar.gz
*tar.gz
*.tar.gsz
*tar.gsz
*.zip
*.sha256

# ── Personal config with API keys ───────────────────────────────────────────
# The real config lives at ~/.config/Tachibana Labs/ACCELA.conf
# Only config.example.conf (styling only, no keys) is tracked
ACCELA.conf

# ── Runtime / cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyc
.venv/
*.log
logs/

# ── Temp/working dirs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
backups/
depots/
manifests/
morrenus_manifests/
hubcap_manifests/
*.db

# ── Workshop keys (personal) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
workshop_keys.txt

# ── GIFs (large media) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
gifs/

# ── Local scratch space ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# scripts/ is intentionally TRACKED — the pre-release checker and test suite
# are the gate against shipping a broken build, so they belong in history.
# Only throwaway experiments go in scratch/.
scratch/

# ── Plugin distribution & R2 publishing ──────────────────────────────────────
/plugins_manifest.json
/plugins/
!src/res/plugins/
r2-publish/
.wrangler/
cloud/
depotmapping.md
pluginfindings.md

# ── Optional components (downloaded on demand from R2) ───────────────────────
src/deps/Goldberg/
src/deps/Steamless/
src/deps/SLScheevo/

# ── OS junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── VitePress / Docs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
docs/.vitepress/dist/
docs/.vitepress/cache/
